#: advancedTabDialog.cpp:39 htmlopts.cpp:98
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Gevorderde Opsies"

#: appearance.cpp:33
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Fonts</h1>On this page, you can configure which fonts Konqueror "
"should use to display the web pages you view."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Skriftipes</h1>Op hierdie bladsy, kan jy konfigureer watter "
"skriftipes Konqueror moet gebruik om die webbladsye wat jy besigtig te vertoon "
"."

#: appearance.cpp:43
msgid "Font Si&ze"
msgstr "Skriftipe Grootte"

#: appearance.cpp:46 appearance.cpp:62
msgid "This is the relative font size Konqueror uses to display web sites."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die relatiewe skriftipe grootte wat Konqueror gebruik om web tuistes "
"te vertoon."

#: appearance.cpp:49
msgid "M&inimum font size:"
msgstr "Minimum skriftipe grootte:"

#: appearance.cpp:53
msgid ""
"Konqueror will never display text smaller than this size,"
"<br>overriding any other settings"
msgstr ""
"Konqueror sal nooit teks vertoon wat kleiner is as hierdie grootte nie, "
"<br>oorskryf enige ander verstellings"

#: appearance.cpp:57
msgid "&Medium font size:"
msgstr "Medium skriftipe grootte:"

#: appearance.cpp:67
msgid "S&tandard font:"
msgstr "Standaard skriftipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:75
msgid "This is the font used to display normal text in a web page."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skriftipe wat gebruik word om normale teks in 'n web bladsy "
"vertoon."

#: appearance.cpp:88
msgid "&Fixed font:"
msgstr "Vaste skriftipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:96
msgid "This is the font used to display fixed-width (i.e. non-proportional) text."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skriftipe wat gebruik word om vaste-wydte (d.i. "
"nie-proporsionele) teks te  vertoon ."

#: appearance.cpp:109
msgid "S&erif font:"
msgstr "Serif skriftipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:117
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as serif."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skriftipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat gemerk is as "
"serif."

#: appearance.cpp:130
msgid "Sa&ns serif font:"
msgstr "Sans serif skriftipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:138
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as sans-serif."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skriftipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat gemerk is as "
"sans-serif."

#: appearance.cpp:152
msgid "C&ursive font:"
msgstr "Kursiewe skriftipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:160
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as italic."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skriftipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat is gemerk is "
"as kursief."

#: appearance.cpp:174
msgid "Fantas&y font:"
msgstr "Fantasie skriftipe:"

#: appearance.cpp:182
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as a fantasy font."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skriftipe wat gebruik word om teks te vertoon wat gemerk is as "
"'n fantasie skriftipe."

#: appearance.cpp:196
msgid "Font &size adjustment for this encoding:"
msgstr "Skriftipe grootte aanpassing vir hierdie enkodering:"

#: appearance.cpp:208
msgid "Default encoding:"
msgstr "Verstek enkodering:"

#: appearance.cpp:216 appearance.cpp:394
msgid "Use Language Encoding"
msgstr "Gebruik Taal Enkodering"

#: appearance.cpp:220
msgid ""
"Select the default encoding to be used; normally, you will be fine with 'Use "
"language encoding' and should not have to change this."
msgstr ""
"Kies die verstek enkodering om te gebruik; normaalweg sal  'Gebruik Taal "
"Enkodering' voldoende wees en behoort hierdie verstellings nie nodig te wees "
"nie."

#: domainlistview.cpp:47
msgid "Host/Domain"
msgstr "Bediener/Domein"

#: domainlistview.cpp:48
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Beleid"

#: domainlistview.cpp:55
msgid "&New..."
msgstr "Nuwe..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:59
msgid "Chan&ge..."
msgstr "Verander..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:63
msgid "De&lete"
msgstr "Uitwis"

#: domainlistview.cpp:67
msgid "&Import..."
msgstr "Invoer..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:73
msgid "&Export..."
msgstr "Uitvoer..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:82
msgid "Click on this button to manually add a host or domain specific policy."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op hierdie knoppie om eiehandig 'n bediener of domein spesifieke beleid "
"by te voeg."

#: domainlistview.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Click on this button to change the policy for the host or domain selected in "
"the list box."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op hierdie knoppie om die beleid vir die gekose bediener of domein  in "
"die lys-hokkie te wysig."

#: domainlistview.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Click on this button to delete the policy for the host or domain selected in "
"the list box."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op hierdie knoppie om die beleid vir die gekose bediener of domein in die "
"lys-hokkie uit te wis."

#: domainlistview.cpp:133
msgid "You must first select a policy to be changed."
msgstr "Jy moet eerste 'n beleid kies om te verander."

#: domainlistview.cpp:162
msgid "You must first select a policy to delete."
msgstr "Jy moet eerste 'n beleid kies om uit te wis."

#: domainlistview.cpp:199 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Use Global"
msgstr "Gebruik Globaal"

#: domainlistview.cpp:201 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Aanvaar"

#: domainlistview.cpp:203 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Reject"
msgstr "Verwerp"

#: filteropts.cpp:52
msgid "Enable filters"
msgstr "Aktiveer filtreerders"

#: filteropts.cpp:55
msgid "Hide filtered images"
msgstr "Versteek gefiltreerde boodskappe"

#: filteropts.cpp:58
msgid "URL Expressions to Filter"
msgstr "URL Uitdrukking om te filtreer"

#: filteropts.cpp:63
msgid "Expression (e.g. http://www.site.com/ad/*):"
msgstr "Uitdrukking (bv. http://www.site.com/ad/*):"

#: filteropts.cpp:71
msgid "Update"
msgstr "Opdateer"

#: filteropts.cpp:76
msgid "Import..."
msgstr "Invoer..."

#: filteropts.cpp:78
msgid "Export..."
msgstr "Uivoer..."

#: filteropts.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Enable or disable AdBlocK filters. When enabled a set of expressions to be "
"blocked should be defined in the filter list for blocking to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer of deaktiveer AdBlocK filtreerders. Wanneer geaktiveer, moet 'n stel "
"uitdrukkings wat geblok moet word, gedefinieer word in die filtreer lys om "
"effek te hê."

#: filteropts.cpp:91
msgid ""
"When enabled blocked images will be removed from the page completely otherwise "
"a placeholder 'blocked' image will be used."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer aktief sal geblokte beelde geheel en al verwyder word vanaf die blad, "
"andersins sal 'n plekhouer 'geblokte' beeld gebruik word."

#: filteropts.cpp:93
msgid ""
"This is the list of URL filters that will be applied to all linked images and "
"frames. The filters are processed in order so place more generic filters "
"towards the top of the list."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die lys van URL filtreerders wat van toepassing gemaak sal word op "
"alle gekoppelde beelde en rame. Die filtreerders word in volgorde geproseseer. "
"Plaas dus meer algemene filtreerders bo-aan die lys."

#: filteropts.cpp:96
msgid ""
"Enter an expression to filter. Expressions can be defined as either a filename "
"style wildcard e.g. http://www.site.com/ads* or as a full regular expression by "
"surrounding the string with '/' e.g.  //(ad|banner)\\./"
msgstr ""
"Voer 'n uitdrukking in wat gefiltreer moet word. Uitdrukkings kan gedefinieer "
"word  in óf 'n lêernaam styl wildekaart bv. http://www.site.com/ads* óf as a 'n "
"volle gewone uitdrukking deur die string te omraam met '/' bv.  , "
"//(ad|banner)\\./"

#: filteropts.cpp:317
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror AdBlocK</h1> Konqueror AdBlocK allows you to create a list of "
"filters that are checked against linked images and frames. URL's that match are "
"either discarded or replaced with a placeholder image. "
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror AdBlocK</h1> Konqueror AdBlocK laat jou toe om 'n lys van "
"filtreerders op te stel wat getoets is teen gekoppelde beelde en rame. URL'le "
"wat ooreenstem word óf verwerp óf vervang met 'n plekhouer beeld."

#: htmlopts.cpp:41
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Browser</h1> Here you can configure Konqueror's browser "
"functionality. Please note that the file manager functionality has to be "
"configured using the \"File Manager\" configuration module. You can make some "
"settings how Konqueror should handle the HTML code in the web pages it loads. "
"It is usually not necessary to change anything here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Blaaier</h1> Hier kan jy Konqueror se blaaier funksionaliteit "
"konfigureer. Let asseblief daarop dat die lêerbestuurder funksionaliteit "
"gekonfigureer moet word deur die \"Lêer Bestuurder\" konfigurasie module te "
"gebruik. Jy kan sekere versteliings maak,  hoe Konqueror die HTML kode moet "
"hanteer in bladsye wat dit laai. Dit is gewoonlik nie nodig om iets hier te "
"verander nie."

#: htmlopts.cpp:49
msgid "Boo&kmarks"
msgstr "Boekmerke"

#: htmlopts.cpp:50
msgid "Ask for name and folder when adding bookmarks"
msgstr "Vra vir die naam en vouer wanneer boekmerke bygevoeg word"

#: htmlopts.cpp:51
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will allow you to change the title of the "
"bookmark and choose a folder in which to store it when you add a new bookmark."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie hokkie gekies is, sal Konqueror jou toelaat om die titel van die "
"boekmerk te wysig asook die houer te kies waarin dit gestoor moet word wanneer "
"jy 'n nuwe boekmerk byvoeg."

#: htmlopts.cpp:55
msgid "Show only marked bookmarks in bookmark toolbar"
msgstr "Toon slegs gemerkte boekmerke in die boekmerk kieslys"

#: htmlopts.cpp:56
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will show only those bookmarks in the "
"bookmark toolbar which you have marked to do so in the bookmark editor."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie hokkie gekies is, sal Konqueror slegs daardie boekmerke in die "
"boekmerk kieslys vertoon wat jy gemerk het in die boekmerk redigeerder."

#: htmlopts.cpp:65
msgid "Form Com&pletion"
msgstr "Vorm Voltooiïng"

#: htmlopts.cpp:66
msgid "Enable completion of &forms"
msgstr "Stel voltooiïng van vorms in staat"

#: htmlopts.cpp:67
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will remember the data you enter in web forms "
"and suggest it in similar fields for all forms."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie hokkie gekies is, sal Konqueror die data onthou wat jy invoer in "
"web vorms en dit voorstel in soortgelyk velde vir alle vorms."

#: htmlopts.cpp:72
msgid "&Maximum completions:"
msgstr "Maksimum voltooiings:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:75
msgid "Here you can select how many values Konqueror will remember for a form field."
msgstr "Hier jy kan kies hoe veel waardes Konqueror sal onthou vir 'n vorm veld."

#: htmlopts.cpp:83
msgid "Tabbed Browsing"
msgstr "Oortjie Blaaiing"

#: htmlopts.cpp:86
msgid "Open &links in new tab instead of in new window"
msgstr "Open skakels in nuwe oortjie in stede van in nuwe venster"

#: htmlopts.cpp:87
msgid ""
"This will open a new tab instead of a new window in various situations, such as "
"choosing a link or a folder with the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie sal 'n nuwe oortjie open in stede van 'n nuwe venster in verskeie "
"situasies, soos die kies van 'n skakel of 'n vouer met die middelste muis "
"knoppie."

#: htmlopts.cpp:92
msgid "Hide the tab bar when only one tab is open"
msgstr "Verberg die oortjie balk wanneer slegs een oortjie oop is"

#: htmlopts.cpp:93
msgid ""
"This will display the tab bar only if there are two or more tabs. Otherwise it "
"will always be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Dit sal die oortjie balk toon slegs indien daar twee of meer oortjies is. "
"Andersins sal dit altyd vertoon word."

#: htmlopts.cpp:108
msgid "Mouse Beha&vior"
msgstr "Muis Gedrag"

#: htmlopts.cpp:110
msgid "Chan&ge cursor over links"
msgstr "Verander plekaanduier oor skakel"

#: htmlopts.cpp:111
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the shape of the cursor will change (usually to a hand) "
"if it is moved over a hyperlink."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gestel is, sal die vorm van die plekaanduier verander "
"(gewoonlik na 'n hand) wanneer dit oor 'n hiperskakel beweeg word."

#: htmlopts.cpp:115
msgid "M&iddle click opens URL in selection"
msgstr "Middel kliek maak gekose URL oop"

#: htmlopts.cpp:117
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can open the URL in the selection by middle "
"clicking on a Konqueror view."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie hokkie gekies is, kan jy die gekose URL oopmaak deur te middel "
"kliek op 'n Konqueror vertoning."

#: htmlopts.cpp:121
msgid "Right click goes &back in history"
msgstr "Regs kliek gaan terug in geskiedenis"

#: htmlopts.cpp:123
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can go back in history by right clicking on a "
"Konqueror view. To access the context menu, press the right mouse button and "
"move."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie hokkie gekies is, kan jy in geskiedenis teruggaan deur regs te "
"kliek op 'n Konqueror vertoning. Om toegang te verkry tot die konteks kieslys, "
"druk die regterkantste muis knoppie en beweeg."

#: htmlopts.cpp:132
msgid "A&utomatically load images"
msgstr "Laai beelde outomaties"

#: htmlopts.cpp:133
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will automatically load any images that are "
"embedded in a web page. Otherwise, it will display placeholders for the images, "
"and you can then manually load the images by clicking on the image button."
"<br>Unless you have a very slow network connection, you will probably want to "
"check this box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie hokkie gekies is, sal Konqueror automaties enige beelde laai wat "
"verskans is in 'n web bladsy. Andersins, sal dit plekhouers vertoon vir die "
"beelde, en jy kan dan eiehandig die beelde laai deur op die beeld knoppie te "
"kliek."
"<br>Tensy jy 'n baie stadige netwerk verbinding het, sal jy waarskynlik hierdie "
"hokkie wil kies om jou blaai ervaring te verbeter."

#: htmlopts.cpp:138
msgid "Dra&w frame around not completely loaded images"
msgstr "Trek raam rondom onvolledig gelaaide beelde"

#: htmlopts.cpp:139
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will draw a frame as placeholder around not "
"yet fully loaded images that are embedded in a web page."
"<br>Especially if you have a slow network connection, you will probably want to "
"check this box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie hokkie gekies is, sal Konqueror 'n raam trek as plekhouer rondom "
"onvolledige gelaaide beelde wat verskans is in 'n web bladsy."
"<br>Veral indien jy 'n stadige netwerk verbinding het, sal jy moontlik hierdie "
"hokkie wil kies om jou blaai ervaring te verbeter."

#: htmlopts.cpp:144
msgid "Allow automatic delayed &reloading/redirecting"
msgstr "Laat outomatiese vertraag herlaaiing/hersending toe"

#: htmlopts.cpp:146
msgid ""
"Some web pages request an automatic reload or redirection after a certain "
"period of time. By unchecking this box Konqueror will ignore these requests."
msgstr ""
"Sommige web bladsye versoek 'n outomatiese herlaai of hersending na 'n sekere "
"tydsperiode. Deur hierdie hokkie nie te kies nie, sal Konqueror hierdie "
"versoeke ignoreer."

#: htmlopts.cpp:158
msgid "Und&erline links:"
msgstr "Onderstreep skakels:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:161
msgid ""
"_: underline\n"
"Enabled"
msgstr "Geaktiveer"

#: htmlopts.cpp:162
msgid ""
"_: underline\n"
"Disabled"
msgstr "Gedeaktiveer"

#: htmlopts.cpp:163
msgid "Only on Hover"
msgstr "Slegs op Sweef"

#: htmlopts.cpp:167
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror handles underlining hyperlinks:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Enabled</b>: Always underline links</li>"
"<li><b>Disabled</b>: Never underline links</li>"
"<li><b>Only on Hover</b>: Underline when the mouse is moved over the link</li>"
"</ul>"
"<br><i>Note: The site's CSS definitions can override this value</i>"
msgstr ""
"Kontroles hoe Konqueror die onderstreep van hiperskakels hanteer:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Geaktiveer</b>: Altyd onderstreep skakel</li>"
"<li><b>Gedeaktiveerd</b>: Nooit onderstreep skakels</li>"
"<li><b>Slegs op Sweef</b>: Onderstreep wanneer die muis oor die skakel "
"beweeg</li></ul>"
"<br><i>Nota: Die tuiste se Css definisies kan hierdie waarde oorskryf</i>"

#: htmlopts.cpp:178
msgid "A&nimations:"
msgstr "Animasies:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:181
msgid ""
"_: animations\n"
"Enabled"
msgstr "Geaktiveer"

#: htmlopts.cpp:182
msgid ""
"_: animations\n"
"Disabled"
msgstr "Gedeaktiveerd"

#: htmlopts.cpp:183
msgid "Show Only Once"
msgstr "Vertoon Slegs Een maal"

#: htmlopts.cpp:187
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror shows animated images:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Enabled</b>: Show all animations completely.</li>"
"<li><b>Disabled</b>: Never show animations, show the start image only.</li>"
"<li><b>Show only once</b>: Show all animations completely but do not repeat "
"them.</li>"
msgstr ""
"Kontroles hoe Konqueror geanimeerde beelde vertoon:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Geaktiveer</b>: Vertoon alle animasie ten volle.</li>"
"<li><b>Gedeaktiveerd</b>: Vertoon animasie nooit, vertoon slegs die begin "
"beeld.</li>"
"<li><b>Vertoon slegs een maal</b>: Vertoon alle animasie ten volle maar moet "
"hulle nie herhaal nie.</li>"

#: javaopts.cpp:62 jsopts.cpp:48 pluginopts.cpp:58
msgid "Global Settings"
msgstr "Globale Verstellings"

#: javaopts.cpp:64
msgid "Enable Ja&va globally"
msgstr "Aktiveer Java globaal"

#: javaopts.cpp:79
msgid "Java Runtime Settings"
msgstr "Java Looptyd Verstellings"

#: javaopts.cpp:85
msgid "&Use security manager"
msgstr "Gebruik sekuriteit bestuurder"

#: javaopts.cpp:89
msgid "Use &KIO"
msgstr "Gebruik &KIO"

#: javaopts.cpp:93
msgid "Shu&tdown applet server when inactive"
msgstr "Skakel miniprogram bediener af wanneer onaktief"

#: javaopts.cpp:101
msgid "App&let server timeout:"
msgstr "Miniprogram bediener tydverstreke:"

#: javaopts.cpp:102
msgid " sec"
msgstr "sek"

#: javaopts.cpp:107
msgid "&Path to Java executable, or 'java':"
msgstr "Pad na Java uitvoerbare, of 'Java':"

#: javaopts.cpp:115
msgid "Additional Java a&rguments:"
msgstr "Addisionele Java argumente:"

#: javaopts.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in Java that can be contained in HTML "
"pages. Note that, as with any browser, enabling active contents can be a "
"security problem."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die uitvoering van skrifte geskryf in Java wat ingesluit kan wees  in "
"HTML bladsye.  Let daarop dat, soos met enige blaaier, aktivering van aktiewe "
"inhoud kan 'n sekuriteit probleem veroorsaak."

#: javaopts.cpp:126
msgid ""
"This box contains the domains and hosts you have set a specific Java policy "
"for. This policy will be used instead of the default policy for enabling or "
"disabling Java applets on pages sent by these domains or hosts. "
"<p>Select a policy and use the controls on the right to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie hokkie bevat die domein en bedieners waarvoor jy 'n spesifieke Java "
"beleid opgestel het. Hierdie beleid sal gebruik word instede  van die verstek "
"beleid vir die aktivering of deaktivering van Java miniprogramme op bladsye wat "
"deur hierdie domeine of bedieners gestuur is. "
"<p>Kies 'n beleid en gebruik die kontroles op die regterkant om dit aan te pas."

#: javaopts.cpp:133
msgid ""
"Click this button to choose the file that contains the Java policies. These "
"policies will be merged with the existing ones. Duplicate entries are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie om die lêer te kies wat die Java beleide bevat. Hierdie "
"beleide sal saamgevlans word met die bestaandes. Duplikaat inskrywings word "
"geignoreer."

#: javaopts.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Click this button to save the Java policy to a zipped file. The file, named <b>"
"java_policy.tgz</b>, will be saved to a location of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie om die java beleid na 'n geritste lêer te stoor. Die "
"lêer, genaamd <b>java_policy.tgz</b>, sal gestoor word na 'n ligging van jou "
"keuse."

#: javaopts.cpp:140
msgid ""
"Here you can set specific Java policies for any particular host or domain. To "
"add a new policy, simply click the <i>New...</i> button and supply the "
"necessary information requested by the dialog box. To change an existing "
"policy, click on the <i>Change...</i> button and choose the new policy from the "
"policy dialog box. Clicking on the <i>Delete</i> button will remove the "
"selected policy, causing the default policy setting to be used for that domain."
msgstr ""
"Hier kan jy spesifieke Java beleide opstel vir enige spesifieke bediener of "
"domein. Om 'n nuwe beleid by te voeg kliek eenvoudig die <i>Voeg by...</i> "
"knoppie en verskaf die nodige inligting soos versoek deur die dialoog hokkie. "
"Om 'n bestaande beleid, te verander, kliek op die <i>Verander...</i> "
"knoppie en kies die nuwe beleid van die beleid dialoog hokkie. Deur op die <i>"
"Uitvee</i> knoppie te kliek, sal die gekose beleid verwyder wat sal veroorsaak "
"dat die verstek beleid opset gebruik word vir daardie domein."

#: javaopts.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Enabling the security manager will cause the jvm to run with a Security Manager "
"in place. This will keep applets from being able to read and write to your file "
"system, creating arbitrary sockets, and other actions which could be used to "
"compromise your system. Disable this option at your own risk. You can modify "
"your $HOME/.java.policy file with the Java policytool utility to give code "
"downloaded from certain sites more permissions."
msgstr ""
"Aktivering van die sekuriteit bestuurder sal veroorsaak dat die jvm hardloop "
"met 'n sekuriteit bestuurder in plek. Hierdie sal miniprogramme keer om in "
"staat te wees om na jou lêer stelsel te lees of skryf, deur arbitêre sokets en "
"ander aksies te skep wat gebruik kan word om jou stelsel te kompromiseer. "
"Deaktiveer hierdie opsie op jou eie risiko. Jy kan jou $Huis/.Java.beleid lêer "
"verander met die Java beleid gereedskap program om kodes wat van sekere tuistes "
"afgelaai is meer regte te gee."

#: javaopts.cpp:161
msgid "Enabling this will cause the jvm to use KIO for network transport "
msgstr ""
"Die aktivering hiervan sal veroorsaak dat die jvm KIO gebruik vir netwerk "
"verkeer"

#: javaopts.cpp:163
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the java executable. If you want to use the jre in your path, "
"simply leave it as 'java'. If you need to use a different jre, enter the path "
"to the java executable (e.g. /usr/lib/jdk/bin/java), or the path to the "
"directory that contains 'bin/java' (e.g. /opt/IBMJava2-13)."
msgstr ""
"Voer die roete in na die Java uitvoerbare.  Indien jy die jre in jou roete wil "
"gebruik, los dit eenvoudig as 'java'.  Indien jy nodig het om 'n verskillende "
"jre te gebruik, voer die roete na die java uitvoerbare in (bv. "
"/usr/lib/jdk/bin/java), of die roete na die gids wat  ' bin /java' (e.g. "
"/opt/IBMJava2-13) bevat."

#: javaopts.cpp:168
msgid ""
"If you want special arguments to be passed to the virtual machine, enter them "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Indien jy wil hê dat spesiale argumente na die virtuele masjien aangestuur moet "
"word, voer hulle hier in."

#: javaopts.cpp:170
msgid ""
"When all the applets have been destroyed, the applet server should shut down. "
"However, starting the jvm takes a lot of time. If you would like to keep the "
"java process running while you are browsing, you can set the timeout value to "
"whatever you like. To keep the java process running for the whole time that the "
"konqueror process is, leave the Shutdown Applet Server checkbox unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer al die  miniprogramme vernietig is, moet die miniprogram bediener "
"afskakel.  Om die jvm te begin neem egter baie tyd. Indien jy sou verkies om "
"die java proses aan die hardloop te hou terwyl jy blaai, kan jy die "
"tydverstreke waarde stel na waarvan jy hou. Om die java proses aan die hardloop "
"te hou vir die hele tydsduur wat die konqueror dit prosesseer, los die Afskakel "
"miniprogram bediener keuseblokkie ongemerk."

#: javaopts.cpp:285 pluginopts.cpp:642
msgid "Doma&in-Specific"
msgstr "Domein-Spesifiek"

#: javaopts.cpp:318
msgid "New Java Policy"
msgstr "Nuwe Java Beleid"

#: javaopts.cpp:321
msgid "Change Java Policy"
msgstr "Verander Java Beleid"

#: javaopts.cpp:325
msgid "&Java policy:"
msgstr "Java beleid:"

#: javaopts.cpp:326
msgid "Select a Java policy for the above host or domain."
msgstr "Kies 'n Java beleid vir die boostaande bediener of domein."

#: jsopts.cpp:51
msgid "Ena&ble JavaScript globally"
msgstr "Aktiveer JavaSkrip globaal"

#: jsopts.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in ECMA-Script (also known as "
"JavaScript) that can be contained in HTML pages. Note that, as with any "
"browser, enabling scripting languages can be a security problem."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die uitvoering van skripte, geskryf in ECMA-Script (ook bekend as "
"Javaskrip), wat vervat kan word in HTML bladsye. Let daarop dat, soos met enige "
"blaaier, die aktivering van skrip tale 'n sekuriteitsprobleem kan wees."

#: jsopts.cpp:58
msgid "Report &errors"
msgstr "Rapporteer foute"

#: jsopts.cpp:59
msgid "Enables the reporting of errors that occur when JavaScript code is executed."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die rapportering van foute wat ontstaan wanneer JavaSkrip kode "
"uitgevoer word."

#: jsopts.cpp:63
msgid "Enable debu&gger"
msgstr "Aktiveer Ontfouter"

#: jsopts.cpp:64
msgid "Enables builtin JavaScript debugger."
msgstr "Aktiveer ingeboude JavaSkrip ontfouter"

#: jsopts.cpp:72
msgid ""
"Here you can set specific JavaScript policies for any particular host or "
"domain. To add a new policy, simply click the <i>New...</i> "
"button and supply the necessary information requested by the dialog box. To "
"change an existing policy, click on the <i>Change...</i> "
"button and choose the new policy from the policy dialog box. Clicking on the <i>"
"Delete</i> button will remove the selected policy causing the default policy "
"setting to be used for that domain. The <i>Import</i> and <i>Export</i> "
"button allows you to easily share your policies with other people by allowing "
"you to save and retrieve them from a zipped file."
msgstr ""
"Hier kan jy spesifieke JavaSkrip beleide opstel vir enige spesifieke bediener "
"of domein. Om 'n nuwe beleid by te voeg, kliek eenvoudig die <i>Voeg by...</i> "
"knoppie en verskaf die nodige inligting soos deur die dialoogblok versoek. Om "
"'n bestaande beleid te wysig, kliek op die  <i>verander...</i> "
"knoppie en kies die nuwe beleid van die beleid dialoogblok. Deur op die <i>"
"Uitvee</i> knoppie te kliek, sal die gekose beleid verwyder, wat veroorsaak dat "
"die verstek beleidsverstelling gebruik word vir daardie domein. Die <i>"
"Invoer</i> en <i>Uitvoer</i> knoppies laat jou toe om jou beleide maklik te "
"deel met ander mense deur jou toe te laat om dit na en van geritste lêers te "
"stoor en te herwin."

#: jsopts.cpp:82
msgid ""
"This box contains the domains and hosts you have set a specific JavaScript "
"policy for. This policy will be used instead of the default policy for enabling "
"or disabling JavaScript on pages sent by these domains or hosts. "
"<p>Select a policy and use the controls on the right to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie blok bevat die domeine en bedieners waarvoor jy 'n spesifieke JavaSkrip "
"beleid opgestel het. Hierdie beleid sal gebruik word in stede van die verstek "
"beleid vir die aktivering en deaktivering van JavaSkrip op bladsye wat deur "
"hierdie domeine of bedieners gestuur is. "
"<p>Kies 'n beleid en gebruik die kontroles aan die regterkant om dit te wysig."

#: jsopts.cpp:89
msgid ""
"Click this button to choose the file that contains the JavaScript policies. "
"These policies will be merged with the existing ones. Duplicate entries are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie om die lêer te kies wat die JavaSkrip beleide bevat. "
"Hierdie beleide sal saamgesmelt word met die bestaandes. Duplikaat inskrywings "
"word ignoreer."

#: jsopts.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Click this button to save the JavaScript policy to a zipped file. The file, "
"named <b>javascript_policy.tgz</b>, will be saved to a location of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie om die JavaSkrip beleid na 'n geritste lêer te stoor. Die "
"lêer, genaamd <b>javascript_policy.tgz</b>, sal gestoor wees na 'n ligging van "
"jou keuse."

#: jsopts.cpp:98
msgid "Global JavaScript Policies"
msgstr "Globale JavaSkrip Beleid"

#: jsopts.cpp:169
msgid "Do&main-Specific"
msgstr "Domein-Spesifiek"

#: jsopts.cpp:205
msgid "New JavaScript Policy"
msgstr "Nuwe JavaSkrip Beleid"

#: jsopts.cpp:208
msgid "Change JavaScript Policy"
msgstr "Verander JavaSkrip Beleid"

#: jsopts.cpp:212
msgid "JavaScript policy:"
msgstr "JavaSkrip beleid:"

#: jsopts.cpp:213
msgid "Select a JavaScript policy for the above host or domain."
msgstr "Kies 'n JavaSkrip beleid vir die boostaande bediener of domein."

#: jsopts.cpp:215
msgid "Domain-Specific JavaScript Policies"
msgstr "Domein Spesifieke JavaSkrip Beleide"

#: jspolicies.cpp:148
msgid "Open new windows:"
msgstr "Open nuwe vensters:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:157 jspolicies.cpp:212 jspolicies.cpp:250 jspolicies.cpp:288
#: jspolicies.cpp:329
msgid "Use global"
msgstr "Gebruik Globaal"

#: jspolicies.cpp:158 jspolicies.cpp:213 jspolicies.cpp:251 jspolicies.cpp:289
#: jspolicies.cpp:330
msgid "Use setting from global policy."
msgstr "Gebruik verstelling vanaf globale beleid."

#: jspolicies.cpp:164 jspolicies.cpp:219 jspolicies.cpp:257 jspolicies.cpp:295
#: jspolicies.cpp:336
msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Laat toe"

#: jspolicies.cpp:165
msgid "Accept all popup window requests."
msgstr "Aanvaar alle opspring venster versoeke."

#: jspolicies.cpp:170
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "Vra"

#: jspolicies.cpp:171
msgid "Prompt every time a popup window is requested."
msgstr "Por elke keer wanneer 'n opspring venster versoek word"

#: jspolicies.cpp:176
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Verbied"

#: jspolicies.cpp:177
msgid "Reject all popup window requests."
msgstr "Verwerp alle opspring venster versoeke."

#: jspolicies.cpp:182
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "Luukse"

#: jspolicies.cpp:183
msgid ""
"Accept popup window requests only when links are activated through an explicit "
"mouse click or keyboard operation."
msgstr ""
"Aanvaar opspring venster versoeke slegs wanneer skakels aktiveer word deur 'n "
"eksplisiete muis kliek of sleutelbord operasie."

#: jspolicies.cpp:190
msgid ""
"If you disable this, Konqueror will stop interpreting the <i>window.open()</i> "
"JavaScript command. This is useful if you regularly visit sites that make "
"extensive use of this command to pop up ad banners."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Note:</b> Disabling this option might also break certain sites that "
"require <i>window.open()</i> for proper operation. Use this feature carefully."
msgstr ""
"Indien jy hierdie deaktiveer, sal konqueror ophou om die <i>venster.open()</i> "
"Javaskrip opdrag te interpreteer. Hierdie is handig wanneer jy gereeld tuistes "
"besoek wat ekstensief gebruik maak van hierdie opdrag om advertensie baniere te "
"laat opspring. "
"<br>"
"<br><b>Nota:</b> Deaktivering van hierdie opsie mag dalk sekere tuistes laat "
"breek wat <i>venster.open()</i>  vereis vir behoorlike operasionalisering. "
"Gebruik hierdie eienskap versigtig"

#: jspolicies.cpp:204
msgid "Resize window:"
msgstr "Verstel venstergrootte:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:220
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window size."
msgstr "Laat skripte toe die venstergrootte te verander."

#: jspolicies.cpp:225 jspolicies.cpp:263 jspolicies.cpp:301 jspolicies.cpp:342
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Ignoreer"

#: jspolicies.cpp:226
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window size. The web page will <i>"
"think</i> it changed the size but the actual window is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Ignoreer pogings van skripte om venstergroottes te verander. Die web bladsy sal "
"<i>dink</i> dat dit die grootte verander het, maar die eintlike venster sal nie "
"beinvloed wees nie."

#: jspolicies.cpp:233
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window size on their own by using <i>"
"window.resizeBy()</i> or <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. This option specifies the "
"treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Sommige web tuistes verander die venstergrootte op hul eie deur gebruik te maak "
"van <i>window.resizeBy()</i> of <i>window.resizeTo()</i>"
". Hierdie opsie spesifiseer hoe sulke pogings hanteer moet word."

#: jspolicies.cpp:242
msgid "Move window:"
msgstr "Skuif venster:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:258
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window position."
msgstr "Laat skripte toe om die venster posisie te verander."

#: jspolicies.cpp:264
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window position. The web page will <i>"
"think</i> it moved the window but the actual position is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Ignoreer pogings van skripte om die venster posisie te verander. Die web bladsy "
"sal <i>dink</i> dat dit die venster verskuif het maar die eintlike posisie is "
"nie affekteer nie."

#: jspolicies.cpp:271
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window position on their own by using <i>"
"window.moveBy()</i> or <i>window.moveTo()</i>. This option specifies the "
"treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Sommige web tuistes verander die venster posisie op hul eie deur gebruik te "
"maak van <i>window.moveBy()</i> of <i>window.moveTo()</i>"
". Hierdie opsie spesifiseer hoe sulke pogings hanteer moet word."

#: jspolicies.cpp:280
msgid "Focus window:"
msgstr "Fokus venster:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:296
msgid "Allow scripts to focus the window."
msgstr "Laat skripte toe om die vensters te fokus"

#: jspolicies.cpp:302
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to focus the window. The web page will <i>think</i> "
"it brought the focus to the window but the actual focus will remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ignoreer pogings van skripte om die venster te fokus. Die web bladsy sal <i>"
"dink</i> dat die fokus na die venster gebring is, maar die eintlike fokus bly "
"onveranderd."

#: jspolicies.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Some websites set the focus to their browser window on their own by using <i>"
"window.focus()</i>. This usually leads to the window being moved to the front "
"interrupting whatever action the user was dedicated to at that time. This "
"option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Sommige web tuistes verstel die venster fokus op hul eie deur gebruik te maak "
"van <i>window.focus()</i>. Dit het gewoonlik tot gevolg dat die venster na vore "
"geskuif word, wat enige aksie, waarmee die gebruiker op daardie oomblik besig "
"was, onderbreek."

#: jspolicies.cpp:321
msgid "Modify status bar text:"
msgstr "Verander status balk teks:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:337
msgid "Allow scripts to change the text of the status bar."
msgstr "Laat skripte toe om die teks van die status balk te verander."

#: jspolicies.cpp:343
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the status bar text. The web page will <i>"
"think</i> it changed the text but the actual text will remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ignoreer pogings van skripte om die status balk teks te verander. Die web "
"bladsy sal <i>dink</i> dat dit die teks verander het, maar die eintlike teks "
"sal onveranderd bly."

#: jspolicies.cpp:351
msgid ""
"Some websites change the status bar text by setting <i>window.status</i> or <i>"
"window.defaultStatus</i>, thus sometimes preventing displaying the real URLs of "
"hyperlinks. This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Sommige web tuistes verander die status balk teks deur <i>window.status</i> "
"of <i>window.defaultStatus</i> te verstel, wat somtyds voorkom dat die werklike "
"URL'e van hiperskakels vertoon word."

