msgstr "Skandeer vir nuwe inproppings na KDE laai"

#. i18n: file nsconfigwidget.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, KDE will look for new Netscape plugins every time it "
"starts up. This makes it easier for you if you often install new plugins, but "
"it may also slow down KDE startup. You might want to disable this option, "
"especially if you seldom install plugins."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie geaktiveer is, sal KDE soek vir nuwe Netscape inproppings elke "
"keer as dit gelaai word. Dit maak dit makliker vir jou indien jy gereeld nuwe "
"inproppings installeer, maar dit kan ook KDE se laaifunksie vertraag. Jy mag "
"dalk kies om hierdie opsie te deaktiveer, veral as jy selde inproppings "
"installeer."

